URL: https://download.gnome.org/sources/pygobject/3.48/pygobject-3.48.2.tar.xz ff8a3c3c9a12eff6ef6453eb0bc81b9b8b67d26873513bd0abd0578bc0fcb4e6
Origname: pygobject-3.48.2
Name: pygobject

    pygobject 3.48.2 (Python GObject bindings) — previously built in Sprint 4 from a bare tarball without a projeny project; brought under projeny now to carry the Fil-C import fix.
